<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Bike Transport from Draksharamam to Hyderabad | Two-Wheeler Shifting Charges
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required to ship my bike from Draksharamam to Hyderabad?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">To move a bike from Draksharamam to Hyderabad you’ll need a valid government‑issued ID, the bike’s registration certificate, a copy of the insurance policy, and a signed e‑Way bill. Shree Ashirwad also asks for a GST‑compliant invoice if the move is corporate‑reimbursable. All paperwork is verified during the doorstep inspection.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does Shree Ashirwad protect my bike during the 850 km highway journey?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Your bike is first inspected, then wrapped in a 7‑layer shock‑absorbent system that includes bubble wrap, high‑density foam edge protectors, corrugated fiberboard, stretch film, and a custom wooden crate for fragile parts. It is loaded onto an enclosed container truck with hydraulic ramps, secured with ratchet lashings, and monitored via GPS live tracking throughout the transit.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my bike parcel in real time while it travels from Draksharamam to Hyderabad?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Shree Ashirwad provides a live GPS dashboard that updates the bike’s location every few minutes. Once the bike is loaded, you’ll receive a tracking link via SMS or email, allowing you to monitor the progress along NH 44 and NH 33 until doorstep delivery in Hyderabad.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is shipping my bike by train or bus a viable alternative to a dedicated mover?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Train parcel and bus services can move two‑wheelers, but they often lack dedicated packing, insurance, and real‑time tracking. Trains may expose the bike to rough handling, while bus carriers have limited space and higher risk of damage. Shree Ashirwad’s enclosed trucks and 7‑layer wrap provide superior safety, insurance coverage, and visibility.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What is the typical cost range for two‑wheeler shifting from Draksharamam to Hyderabad?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">For a standard bike, the total charge usually falls between ₹6,500 and ₹9,500, depending on bike size, required insurance value, and any additional services like disassembly or special crates. The quoted price includes fuel surcharge, driver allowance, packaging, and GST. Exact pricing is provided instantly after a doorstep inspection or online quote request.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How are insurance claims handled if my bike gets damaged during transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Shree Ashirwad offers IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance covering 100 % declared value. In the unlikely event of damage, the driver files a damage report, photographs are taken, and the claim is processed with the insurer within 7‑10 business days. The insured amount is transferred directly to the customer after verification, ensuring a hassle‑free settlement.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
